 ### Eggs and the Nest
 
 - Egg tokens on the Intruder board represent the Eggs in the Nest; taking or destroying Eggs removes them from the Intruder board. When no Eggs remain (all carried away or destroyed), the Nest is destroyed — mark it with 1 Injury marker.
-- **Destroying Eggs:** in a Room with uncarried Eggs, resolve a Shoot or Melee Attack against them — each Injury (of any type) destroys 1 Egg; A **successful Egg Melee** retains the normal draw of **1 Contamination card onto your Action discard pile**. A **missed Egg Melee** causes neither Contamination nor a Wound. The manuals do not specify how to reconcile the normal pre-roll Contamination step with this miss exception; no refund or alternative draw timing is specified. Grenades may be thrown at Rooms with uncarried Eggs as if an Intruder were there: a Grenade destroys 2 Eggs, a Molotov Cocktail 1 Egg. **After every single attempt to destroy an Egg, perform a Noise roll.**
-- A Fire marker in a Room with uncarried Eggs destroys 1 uncarried Egg during each Fire Damage step.
+
+| Method against uncarried Eggs | Egg destruction |
+|---|---|
+| Shoot or Melee | Each Injury destroys **1 Egg**. Resolve the normal attack, with the Egg Melee exception below. |
+| Grenade | Destroys **2 Eggs**. Uncarried Eggs permit the Room to be targeted as if an Intruder were there. |
+| Molotov Cocktail | Destroys **1 Egg** immediately; its Fire marker can continue destroying Eggs in later Fire Damage steps. |
+| **Fire marker** | Destroys **1 uncarried Egg during every Event Phase Fire Damage step**; with Vulnerability to Fire discovered, destroy **2** instead (FAQ Rooms 7). |
+
+- **Egg Melee penalties:** a successful Egg Melee retains the normal draw of **1 Contamination card onto your Action discard pile**. A missed Egg Melee causes neither Contamination nor a Wound. The manuals do not specify how to reconcile the normal pre-roll Contamination step with this miss exception; no refund or alternative draw timing is specified.
+- **Noise after an attack attempt:** after every single Shoot, Melee, Grenade or Molotov attempt to destroy an Egg, perform a Noise roll, including a miss. For a remote Grenade/Molotov, roll in your own Room, not the Nest (FAQ Rooms 2).
 
